{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Descent Into Darkness&quot;</strong>, you must take an elevator down into the depths of a mysterious underground complex, filled with dangers and secrets. Your goal is to find a way out\u2014but with each level, the darkness grows, and the threats become more terrifying...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Endless Descent \u2013 Explore procedurally generated levels, unlock new zones, and search for an escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/0f13eaa5c9ba979b12e18c5713ee3669.poster.avif?t=1771796588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/0f13eaa5c9ba979b12e18c5713ee3669.webm?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/0f13eaa5c9ba979b12e18c5713ee3669.mp4?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Dark Atmosphere \u2013 Eerie visuals and immersive sound design pull you into the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/9643d51e82a77a070c4ae764e480e608.poster.avif?t=1771796588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/9643d51e82a77a070c4ae764e480e608.webm?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/9643d51e82a77a070c4ae764e480e608.mp4?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 First-Person &amp; Third-Person \u2013 Switch perspectives for the ultimate immersive horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/cfde99008e1f48a9c3d51a0b37729632.poster.avif?t=1771796588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/cfde99008e1f48a9c3d51a0b37729632.webm?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/cfde99008e1f48a9c3d51a0b37729632.mp4?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Unspeakable Horrors \u2013 What watches you from the darkness? Don't look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the abyss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/7e570c215e12785a23fb93a116514440.poster.avif?t=1771796588\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/7e570c215e12785a23fb93a116514440.webm?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/extras/7e570c215e12785a23fb93a116514440.mp4?t=1771796588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Singleplayer &amp; Online Co-op \u2013 Survive alone or descend with friends (if you dare).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534750?t=1771796588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534750?t=1771796588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/1db6bd2d870f551f47473b788daf1cca17259963/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771796588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534750/1db6bd2d870f551f47473b788daf1cca17259963/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771796588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Sexual Content\r\nRevealing Outfits: The main character has a series of revealing and provocative outfits that are part of the gameplay and customization.\r\n\r\nUndressing System: The game includes a strictly non-gameplay feature (referred to as the \"editor\" or \"wardrobe\") that allows the player to remove a character's clothing to view the model. Important: This action is not part of the storyline, does not affect gameplay, and is unrelated to other characters. It is a tool for customizing appearance in a static mode.\r\n\r\nViolent Scenes\r\nThe game contains scenes of cruelty, characteristic of the \"horror\" genre."},"demos":[{"appid":3758550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Descent Into Darkness&quot;</strong>, you must take an elevator down into the depths of a mysterious underground complex, filled with dangers and secrets. Your goal is to find a way out\u2014but with each level, the darkness grows, and the threats become more terrifying...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Endless Descent \u2013 Explore procedurally generated levels, unlock new zones, and search for an escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po